	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Milliohm HoLRS1575 bare-alloy shunt, 100uOhm 1% 7W, LCSC C5127845; source: HoS20260413-90 rev.A0 2026-04-13 p.3 W=15.2+/-0.3 A=7.6+/-0.5 H=2.5+/-0.5 T=4.2+/-0.5 D2=2.0+/-0.1mm; recommended land pattern p.6 L=16 A=8.75 B=5.6mm: pads 5.20x8.75mm, pitch 10.80mm. Six paste windows per terminal, 63.16% nominal terminal area; solid zone connections. Four-terminal variant for the Device:R_Shunt symbol: current pads 1 and 4, Kelvin sense pads 2 and 3 = 0.3/0.6mm vias 0.4mm inside the inner edge of pads 1 and 4 (x=-/+3.2, y=0), clear of the paste windows, tented on B.Cu; to be filled and capped (via in pad). Net-tie groups 1-2 and 3-4. Inter-pad band masked and kept free of top copper by a footprint keepout (F.Cu: no pour, tracks or vias). Nominal STEP with simplified bends; underside clearance and assembly process require qualification.")
	(tags "resistor shunt current sense Kelvin 4-terminal net tie Milliohm HoLRS1575 bare alloy 1575 C5127845")
